# .dockerignore — keep secrets, data and local state OUT of the image.
#
# The first three entries are the important ones: a .env or a populated data/
# baked into an image is a credential and a corpus of customer network metadata
# that travels wherever the image goes.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/

results/
notebooks/
docs/
tests/
*.md
!README.md
